    <briefdescription>
<para>Strategy interface for Voice Activity Detection. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Implementations receive a mono float32 PCM buffer and return a list of sample ranges that contain speech. The buffer is assumed to be normalised to [-1, 1].</para>
<para>Thread-safety: implementations must be safe for concurrent calls. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
